  progressTowardsObjective: 0
  fileContents: "Date: \uFFFD\uFFFD\uFFFD\uFFFD, 31\u2588\u2588\r\nSource: Mesla Industries \u2014 Internal Memo\r\nRE: Competitive Threat Assessment\r\n\r\n[DATA_ERR] #!#\xDE\xF8#\xFF!#\xA1\xD7 rival company Defiant has developed a new chipset utilizing subatomic processors, reportedly quadrupling the processing power of their machines. While these claims remain unverified, a public release could severely impact our market sh\u2593re. We may need to accelerate production of [DATA_LOST], and Dr. E\u2588\u2588et will need to be reassigned from Project [DATA_LOST] to assist with dev\uFFFDlopment.\r\n\r\n"
